# Comments

Prefer self-documenting code. Comment **why**, not **what**.

Add comments for: security constraints, AWS/Nest quirks, non-obvious status workflows, justified `any`.

Spacing: blank line above/below mid-block standalone comments; JSDoc directly above symbols.

See `docs/COMMENTS.md`.
